<title>THAILAND: Thaimex says to split operations.</title>
<headline>Thaimex says to split operations.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thaimex Finance and Securities Plc will seek shareholder approval to split its finance and securities arms, the company said in a statement to the Stock Exchange of Thailand on Thursday.</p>
<p>The firm will not hold less than a 99 percent stake in its separated securities arm, the statement said.</p>
<p>Thaimex last week announced plans to merge with Thai finance and securities companies Nava Finance and Securities Plc and CMIC Fiannce and Securities Plc as part of a growing trend of consolidation in the Thai finance sector.</p>
</text>
